        "The upstream documentation states this is not a Telegram session sandbox; the server process retains normal session authority."
      ]
    },
    "secrets_and_account_authority": {
      "decision": "HIGH_PRIVILEGE_SECRET_SURFACE",
      "fit": "LOW_FOR_DEFAULT_TRANSPORT",
      "notes": [
        "API ID, API hash and user session material are high-value credentials.",
        "The candidate can mutate messages, chats/groups, contacts and account settings when write tools are exposed."
      ]
    },
    "local_and_third_party_data": {
      "decision": "UNNEEDED_FOR_CURRENT_SCOPE",
      "fit": "LOW",
      "notes": [
